close_reason: GitHub issue 79 closed after PR 80 hosted checks proved fresh-runner PM and release-path recovery; no release was published.
body: "Preserve current item dependency graphs, use audited pm history-repair to re-anchor the four streams, clear runtime cache, verify strict history validation from the checkout and a clean archive, then close the GitHub blocker only after the scheduled/release workflow path is proven."
